{"author":{"id":"836d943203cf5a4f01ab5d4b4780de84949c43734f2256a167cc5931ae5d8c66"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794180725,"nonce":"silT1sq12pNKO+pccOcspze0weM=","title":"L6 — Top-bar popovers: repo switcher, overflow menu, notifications, identity","message":"## Context\n\"N repositories\", `…`, chat, bell and avatar all send `Message::Noop` (`src/ui/screen.rs:89-113`). Notices, failed repos and write errors are only shown in place (`App.notice`, `failed_count`, `write_errors`, `src/app.rs:217-258`).\n\n## Files\n- `src/ui/popover.rs` — new: a popover anchored to a button, built on a `stack` + scrim like `done::overlay` (`src/ui/done.rs:21`), closed on outside click or Esc\n- `src/app.rs` — `open_popover: Option\u003cPopover\u003e`, `notifications: Vec\u003cNotification\u003e` (capped at 100), `unread`\n- `src/ui/screen.rs:72-122` — `top_bar`\n\n## Approach\n- Repo switcher (\"N repositories\"): lists repos with a status dot (reuse `status_label`, `screen.rs:618`) and open counts. Clicking one sets `filter.repos` and goes to Issues. Includes \"All repositories\".\n- Overflow `…`: Rescan, Add project, Add folder to scan (same messages as `screen.rs:538-540`), Roadmap Done for each repo (`Message::OpenDone`), Keyboard shortcuts (L5 overlay)\n- Bell: a notifications list fed by failed repo loads, write failures and successes, Roadmap Done results and config notices. Shows an unread-count badge on the bell, cleared when opened.\n- Avatar: identity popover showing the git-bug identity name and email (extend whatever `Message::Identified` fetches) and theme preference shortcuts\n- Remove the chat icon: no feature backs it (listed as epic follow-up)\n\n## Depends on\nL5 — Esc handling and the shortcuts menu entry\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- No top-bar control sends `Message::Noop`\n- Unit tests: a failed write pushes a notification and increments `unread`; opening the bell resets `unread`; choosing a repo in the switcher sets `filter.repos` and `section == Issues`\n- Gates pass","files":null}]}